<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>NTTR agency airspace (Sally / Lee / Blackjack)</name>
    <description>Field boxes drawn in zone_server.py. NTTR agency polygons from FAA AIS Special Use Airspace (generalized NASR). Control East/Sally = Desert MOA + R-4806E + Reveille. Control West/Lee = R-4807A/B + R-4808S + R-4809 + an inferred Lee Corridor (11-250; not a published SUA). Blackjack = working restricted areas. Joshua = R-2508 sketch. Not a substitute for the IFG chart.</description>
